<template>
 <view class="oral-setup glass">
  <view class="oral-setup-heading"><view><Bi zh="准备口语练习" fr="Préparer la conversation" /><text class="oral-caption">Whisper · Français · DELF A1</text></view><button v-if="closable" class="icon-button" hover-class="none" @click="$emit('close')" aria-label="关闭 / Fermer"><Icon name="close" /></button></view>
  <view v-if="error" class="oral-error" role="alert">{{ error }}</view>
  <view class="oral-prepare-section"><view class="oral-prepare-title"><Icon name="upload"/><Bi zh="法语识别模型" fr="Modèle français"/><Icon v-if="status.model?.ready" name="check"/></view><text class="oral-caption oral-model-name">Whisper Large V3 French · Q5</text><text class="oral-status">{{ modelLabel }}</text><text v-if="status.recognizer?.state==='preparing'" class="oral-caption" role="status">首次语音准备中 · {{ Math.floor(status.recognizer.elapsedMs/1000) }}s，完成后即可录音 / Préparation du moteur…</text><text v-if="status.recognizer?.ready" class="oral-caption">识别加速：{{ status.recognizer.backend==='gpu'?'显卡 / GPU':'CPU' }}</text><text v-if="status.recognizer?.state==='failed'" class="oral-error">{{ status.recognizer.message }}</text><button v-if="status.recognizer?.state==='failed'" class="button secondary" @click="act('recognizer.prepare')"><Bi zh="重试语音准备" fr="Réessayer la préparation" small/></button><view class="oral-prepare-actions"><button class="button primary" :disabled="busy||status.model?.state==='checking'||['importing','verifying'].includes(status.model?.state)||['recognizing','cancelling'].includes(status.recording)" @click="act('model.import')"><Bi zh="导入本地模型" fr="Importer le modèle" small/></button><button v-if="status.model?.storedBytes" class="button secondary" :disabled="busy||status.recording==='recognizing'" @click="confirmDelete='model'"><Bi zh="删除模型" fr="Supprimer" small/></button></view><text v-if="status.model?.error" class="oral-error">{{ status.model.error }}</text></view>
  <view class="oral-prepare-section"><view class="oral-prepare-title"><Icon name="microphone" /><Bi zh="麦克风" fr="Microphone" /><Icon v-if="microphone" name="check" /></view><button class="button secondary" :class="{'oral-granted':microphone}" hover-class="none" :disabled="micBusy" @click="allowMicrophone"><Icon v-if="microphone" name="check" /><Bi :zh="micBusy?'正在请求授权':microphone?'麦克风已允许':'允许麦克风'" :fr="micBusy?'Autorisation…':microphone?'Microphone autorisé':'Autoriser'" small /></button><text v-if="microphoneError" class="oral-error" role="alert">{{ microphoneError }}</text></view>
  <view class="oral-prepare-section"><view class="oral-prepare-title"><Icon name="link" /><Bi zh="自己的小智考官" fr="Votre examinateur Xiaozhi" /><Icon v-if="connected" name="check" /></view><text class="oral-status">{{ bindingLabel }}</text>
   <text v-if="status.provider?.bound&&!connected" class="oral-caption">设备已绑定 / Appareil associé</text>
   <view v-if="status.provider?.status==='waiting'" class="oral-binding-code"><strong>{{ status.provider.code }}</strong><text>{{ remaining }} · Code d’association</text><button class="button secondary" hover-class="none" @click="copy(status.provider.code)"><Bi zh="复制绑定码" fr="Copier le code" small /></button></view>
   <view class="oral-prepare-actions"><button class="button primary" hover-class="none" :disabled="bindingBusy||['fetching','connecting'].includes(status.provider?.status)" @click="beginBinding"><Bi :zh="bindingAction" :fr="bindingBusy?'Connexion…':connected||status.provider?.bound?'Reconnecter':'Lier Xiaozhi'" small /></button><button class="button secondary" hover-class="none" @click="openConsole"><Bi zh="小智控制台" fr="Console Xiaozhi" small /></button></view>
   <text v-if="bindingError" class="oral-error" role="alert">{{ bindingError }}</text>
   <view class="oral-prepare-actions"><button class="oral-text-action" hover-class="none" @click="copy(examinerConfig)"><Icon name="copy" /><Bi zh="复制考官配置" fr="Copier le rôle" small /></button><button class="oral-text-action" hover-class="none" @click="help=!help"><Icon name="info" /><Bi zh="绑定教程" fr="Guide" small /></button></view>
   <view v-if="help" class="oral-quick-guide"><text>1. 登录自己的小智账号，创建“DELF A1 法语口语考官”，粘贴考官配置，选择可用模型和法语音色。</text><text>2. 在控制台的“添加设备”入口输入本机显示的绑定码，关联到该智能体。具体入口以控制台为准。</text><text>3. 返回应用，等待“考官已连接”。电脑与手机需分别绑定。</text><text>Connectez votre compte, créez l’examinateur, puis ajoutez cet appareil avec le code affiché.</text><text>识别在本机完成；考官对话需要联网，权限和费用以自己的账号及平台规则为准。</text></view>
   <details class="oral-manage"><summary>绑定管理 · Gérer la connexion</summary><button class="oral-text-action" hover-class="none" @click="changeAgent"><Bi zh="更换智能体" fr="Changer d’agent" small /></button><text v-if="agentHelp" class="oral-caption">请在小智控制台调整设备所属智能体，返回后点“重新连接”。 / Modifiez l’agent dans la console puis reconnectez.</text><button class="oral-text-action" hover-class="none" @click="confirmDelete='binding'"><Bi zh="清除本机连接信息" fr="Effacer la connexion locale" small /></button><text class="oral-caption">平台解除绑定请到控制台设备管理中操作。本机清除不会删除口语记录。 / La dissociation du compte se fait dans la console.</text></details>
  </view>
  <button v-if="ready" class="button primary oral-ready" hover-class="none" @click="$emit('ready')"><Bi zh="进入练习" fr="Commencer" /><Icon name="arrow" /></button>
  <text v-else class="oral-caption" aria-live="polite">{{ nextStep }}</text>
  <view v-if="confirmDelete" class="oral-delete-shade"><view class="glass oral-delete-dialog"><Bi :zh="confirmDelete==='model'?'删除识别模型？':'清除本机连接信息？'" :fr="confirmDelete==='model'?'Supprimer le modèle ?':'Effacer la connexion locale ?'" /><text class="oral-caption">学习记录和口语历史会保留。 / Vos séances sont conservées.</text><view class="oral-prepare-actions"><button class="button secondary" hover-class="none" @click="confirmDelete=''" aria-label="取消 / Annuler"><Icon name="close" /></button><button class="button primary" hover-class="none" :disabled="busy" @click="remove"><Bi zh="确认" fr="Confirmer" small /></button></view></view></view>
 </view>
</template>
<script setup>
import {computed,ref,watch,onMounted,onUnmounted} from 'vue';import Bi from './Bi.vue';import Icon from './Icon.vue';import {oralCall} from '../oral/native-bridge.js';import {nativeHost} from '../platform/native.js';import examinerConfig from '../oral/examiner-config.js';
const props=defineProps({closable:Boolean,autoEnter:Boolean});const emit=defineEmits(['close','ready','status','notice']);const status=ref({}),error=ref(''),busy=ref(false),micBusy=ref(false),microphoneError=ref(''),bindingBusy=ref(false),bindingError=ref(''),microphone=ref(false),help=ref(false),agentHelp=ref(false),confirmDelete=ref(''),tick=ref(Date.now());let timer,alive=true,refreshing=false,browserPermission;
const connected=computed(()=>status.value.provider?.status==='connected'),ready=computed(()=>status.value.model?.ready&&status.value.recognizer?.ready!==false&&microphone.value&&connected.value),percent=computed(()=>Math.min(100,Math.floor((status.value.model?.downloaded||0)/(status.value.model?.total||1)*100))),remaining=computed(()=>{const n=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(((status.value.provider?.expires||0)-tick.value)/1000));return `${Math.floor(n/60)}:${String(n%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;});
const modelLabel=computed(()=>({checking:'正在检查模型 / Vérification…',missing:'请导入本地模型 / Importez le modèle',paused:'下载已暂停 / En pause',connecting:'正在连接下载源 / Connexion à la source…',downloading:'正在下载 / Téléchargement…',verifying:'正在校验 / Vérification…',ready:'模型已就绪 · 本机识别 / Modèle prêt',failed:'下载未完成 / Téléchargement incomplet',invalid:'校验未通过 / Modèle invalide',importing:'正在导入并校验 / Importation…'})[status.value.model?.state]||'正在读取 / Chargement…');
const bindingLabel=computed(()=>status.value.provider?.message||'绑定自己的小智账号 / Liez votre compte.');
const bindingAction=computed(()=>bindingBusy.value||status.value.provider?.status==='fetching'?(status.value.provider?.bound?'正在重连':'获取绑定码中'):status.value.provider?.status==='connecting'?'正在连接考官':connected.value||status.value.provider?.bound?'重新连接':status.value.provider?.status==='waiting'?'刷新绑定状态':'绑定小智');
const nextStep=computed(()=>!status.value.model?.ready?'请先导入本地模型 / Importez le modèle.':status.value.recognizer?.ready===false?'语音引擎正在准备，请稍候 / Préparation du moteur…':!microphone.value?'请允许麦克风 / Autorisez le microphone.':status.value.provider?.status==='connecting'?'正在连接考官，完成后自动进入 / Connexion à l’examinateur…':!connected.value?(status.value.provider?.bound?'请查看上方提示并重连考官 / Vérifiez le message et reconnectez.':'请完成小智绑定并等待连接 / Liez votre examinateur.'):'准备完成 / Prêt.');
watch(ready,value=>{if(value&&alive&&props.autoEnter&&!props.closable)emit('ready');});
function size(n=0){return n>=1e9?(n/1e9).toFixed(2)+' GB':(n/1e6).toFixed(1)+' MB';}
function microphoneHost(){const host=nativeHost();return typeof host?.microphonePermission==='function'&&typeof host?.requestMicrophonePermission==='function'?host:null;}
function setMicrophonePermission(permission,notify=false){if(!alive)return;if(permission==='requesting'){micBusy.value=true;return;}if(!['granted','denied','prompt'].includes(permission))return;const wasBusy=micBusy.value,wasGranted=microphone.value;microphone.value=permission==='granted';micBusy.value=false;if(microphone.value){microphoneError.value='';if(wasBusy||notify&&!wasGranted)emit('notice','麦克风已允许 / Microphone autorisé.');}else if(notify&&wasBusy){microphoneError.value='请在系统应用权限中允许麦克风 / Autorisez le microphone dans les paramètres.';emit('notice',microphoneError.value);}}
async function syncMicrophonePermission(){try{const host=microphoneHost();if(host){setMicrophonePermission(host.microphonePermission());return;}if(!browserPermission){browserPermission=await navigator.permissions.query({name:'microphone'});browserPermission.onchange=()=>setMicrophonePermission(browserPermission.state);}setMicrophonePermission(browserPermission.state);}catch{}}
function microphonePermissionEvent(event){if(microphoneHost())setMicrophonePermission(event.detail?.permission,true);}
async function refresh(){if(refreshing)return;refreshing=true;try{await syncMicrophonePermission();const value=await oralCall('status');if(!alive)return;status.value=value;emit('status',{...value,microphone:microphone.value});}catch(e){if(alive)error.value=e.message;}finally{refreshing=false;}}
async function act(method,args={}){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';try{const result=await oralCall(method,args);if(method.startsWith('model.')&&result?.state)status.value={...status.value,model:result};await refresh();return true;}catch(e){error.value=e.message;emit('notice',e.message);return false;}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function beginBinding(){if(bindingBusy.value)return;bindingBusy.value=true;bindingError.value='';emit('notice','正在获取绑定信息 / Activation…');try{const provider=await oralCall('binding.begin');status.value={...status.value,provider};await refresh();}catch(e){bindingError.value=e.message;emit('notice',e.message);}finally{bindingBusy.value=false;}}
async function allowMicrophone(){if(micBusy.value)return;await syncMicrophonePermission();if(microphone.value){emit('notice','麦克风已允许 / Microphone autorisé.');return;}micBusy.value=true;microphoneError.value='';try{const host=microphoneHost();if(host){host.requestMicrophonePermission();return;}const stream=await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({audio:true});stream.getTracks().forEach(t=>t.stop());if(!alive)return;microphone.value=true;micBusy.value=false;emit('notice','麦克风已允许 / Microphone autorisé.');await refresh();}catch(e){micBusy.value=false;microphoneError.value=e.name==='NotFoundError'?'没有找到可用麦克风 / Aucun microphone disponible.':e.name==='NotReadableError'?'麦克风暂时无法使用，请检查系统麦克风开关或其他录音应用 / Microphone indisponible.':'请允许麦克风权限后重试 / Autorisez le microphone.';emit('notice',microphoneError.value);}}
async function copy(text){try{if(navigator.clipboard?.writeText)await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);else{const input=document.createElement('textarea');input.value=text;document.body.append(input);input.select();if(!document.execCommand('copy'))throw Error();input.remove();}error.value='';emit('notice','已复制 / Copié.');}catch{error.value='复制失败，请重试 / Copie impossible.';}}
function openConsole(){const host=nativeHost();if(host)host.openExternalLink('https://xiaozhi.me/');else window.open('https://xiaozhi.me/','_blank','noopener,noreferrer');}
function changeAgent(){agentHelp.value=true;openConsole();}
async function remove(){await act(confirmDelete.value==='model'?'model.delete':'binding.clear',{confirmed:true});confirmDelete.value='';}
function resume(){if(document.visibilityState==='visible'){oralCall('resume').catch(()=>{});refresh();}}
onMounted(async()=>{document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',resume);window.addEventListener('qihang-resume',resume);window.addEventListener('qihang-microphone-permission',microphonePermissionEvent);await refresh();if(alive)timer=setInterval(()=>{tick.value=Date.now();refresh();},1000);});onUnmounted(()=>{alive=false;clearInterval(timer);if(browserPermission)browserPermission.onchange=null;document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange',resume);window.removeEventListener('qihang-resume',resume);window.removeEventListener('qihang-microphone-permission',microphonePermissionEvent);});
</script>
<style scoped>
.oral-setup{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.oral-setup-heading>view,.oral-prepare-title>.bi{min-width:0}.oral-prepare-title>.icon,.oral-text-action>.icon{flex-shrink:0}.oral-setup :deep(.bi){min-width:0;max-width:100%;white-space:normal}.oral-setup :deep(.bi-zh),.oral-setup :deep(.bi-fr){white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.6}.oral-prepare-actions>.button,.oral-prepare-actions>.oral-text-action{min-width:0;flex:1 1 110px;height:auto;line-height:1.6;white-space:normal;justify-content:center}.oral-binding-code>strong{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.oral-delete-dialog{box-sizing:border-box;width:min(340px,100%);max-height:calc(100dvh - 36px);overflow-y:auto}.oral-source-options{min-width:0;flex-wrap:wrap}.oral-source-picker{flex-wrap:wrap}.oral-source-picker>.bi{flex:1 1 130px}.oral-source-picker>.oral-source-options{flex:1 1 auto}.oral-ready{height:auto;min-height:48px;line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:380px),(max-height:560px){.oral-setup{padding:15px!important}.oral-prepare-section{margin-top:13px!important;padding-top:13px!important}.oral-prepare-title{gap:8px}.oral-delete-shade{padding:18px}.oral-delete-dialog{padding:19px}.oral-prepare-actions{gap:7px}.oral-prepare-actions>.button{padding:9px 7px}}
.oral-model-name{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.7;color:#8b9bb1}.oral-source-picker{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:15px}.oral-source-options{display:flex;gap:7px}.oral-source-options>.button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;min-width:78px;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #d5e0ef;border-radius:12px;background:#f7faff}.oral-source-options>.button.selected{border-color:#8fa7ce;background:#e4ecf9;color:#496a9b}.oral-source-options .icon{width:14px;height:14px}.oral-granted{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#edf5ef!important;border-color:#b7cebf!important;color:#4f7c64!important}.oral-granted>.icon{width:18px;height:18px}
@media(max-width:720px){
 .oral-setup{padding:15px;border-radius:18px}.oral-setup-heading{gap:9px}.oral-setup-heading>.icon-button{width:36px;height:36px;flex:none}.oral-setup :deep(.bi-zh){font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.oral-setup :deep(.bi-fr){font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}.oral-setup .oral-caption{font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;margin:6px 0}.oral-setup .oral-prepare-section{margin-top:13px;padding-top:13px}.oral-setup .oral-prepare-title{gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px}.oral-prepare-title>.icon{width:17px;height:17px}.oral-setup .oral-status,.oral-setup .oral-error{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}.oral-setup .oral-prepare-actions{gap:7px;margin-top:10px}.oral-setup .oral-prepare-actions>.button,.oral-setup .oral-prepare-actions>.oral-text-action{min-height:40px;height:auto;min-width:0;flex:1 1 100px;padding:8px;border-radius:12px;gap:6px}.oral-setup .oral-source-picker{gap:8px;margin-top:11px}.oral-setup .oral-source-options>.button{min-width:69px;min-height:36px;padding:7px 9px}.oral-setup .oral-binding-code{gap:8px;margin:10px 0}.oral-binding-code>strong{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:3px}.oral-setup .oral-binding-code>text{font-size:10px}.oral-setup .oral-quick-guide{font-size:10px;padding:12px;gap:7px;line-height:1.75}.oral-setup .oral-manage{font-size:10px;margin-top:10px}.oral-setup .oral-manage>.oral-text-action{padding:8px 10px;margin-top:7px}.oral-setup .oral-ready{min-height:43px;margin-top:14px;padding:10px 12px}.oral-setup .oral-delete-dialog{padding:18px}
}
</style>